<p align="center">
  <a href="https://github.com/crazy-max/WindowsSpyBlocker/releases/latest"><img src="https://img.shields.io/github/release/crazy-max/WindowsSpyBlocker.svg?style=flat-square" alt="GitHub release"></a>
